{
  "abstract": "A Lean development of the construction of an ordinary finite 3-uniform hypergraph with transcendental Turán density, via a quadrant Green kernel, finite positive rooted obstructions, rational optimization with free root weights, and an ordinary single-graph product transfer. The complete unconditional Lean proof includes an executable finite witness and the ordinary extremal-density limit. The full source build and final transitive axiom audit have passed. Independent statement comparison and the permitted-axiom check passed, and Lean and NanoDa accepted the solution. The selected con-ron replay produced a recognized advisory fuel decline.",
